# Trial Of The Scholar (Q214), a second class-change test for wizards, first part, played by a level 36
# Human Wizard who already holds all but the last brown scroll scrap (every script roll pinned to 1, so
# every drop lands): Mirien starts it and pays the level 35 set's Dimensional Diamonds; Sylvain, Maria,
# Lucas and Creta pass the letters and paintings round until the Leto lizardman warrior drops the last
# scroll scrap and Maria turns the scraps into the crystal of purity; Sylvain trades the crystal for his
# symbol, and Mirien trades the symbol for the second sigil; then relog, and Sylvain, who has done his part,
# says so. The server drops a client's packets past 160 a second, which a scenario played at full speed reaches,
# so the trial is played in three parts.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q214_trial_of_the_scholar.golden
character Scholar 36
class 11
random always 1
hold 2687 4
